# Stage 11 — apply the naming rule consistently.
#
# The rule: where the f belongs to the word (gform, gforms, gfield, ginput),
# only the g changes — kform, kforms, kfield, kinput. Where the gf is the
# Gravity Forms abbreviation and the following letters start a new word, the
# whole gf becomes kdna.
#
# Three constants were renamed as GF -> KDNA, but their F is the F of FORMS, so
# the mechanical rule ate the first letter of the word and left KDNAORMS_.
#
# gficon is gf + icon, so the f is the abbreviation and not part of the word;
# it should have gone to kdnaicon rather than kficon. This is the icon class
# prefix only — the font family it renders with is kform-icons-*, from gform-,
# which is correct as it stands.

KDNAORMS_DOING_MOCK                KFORMS_DOING_MOCK
KDNAORMS_SAVE_REQUEST_JSON_START   KFORMS_SAVE_REQUEST_JSON_START
KDNAORMS_SAVE_REQUEST_JSON_END     KFORMS_SAVE_REQUEST_JSON_END
